<title>INDIA: India Reliance H1 96/97 net seen down.</title>
<headline>India Reliance H1 96/97 net seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private firm Reliance Industries is expected to post a sharp fall in net profit for the six months ended September 30, 1996, a Reuters poll of leading securities firms said.</p>
<p>The average net profit forecast by 14 major securities firms for Reliance was 4.7 billion rupees, 25.8 percent down from the first six months of the previous year.</p>
<p>Sales were forecast to fall 21.1 percent to an average 31.3 billion rupees during the period.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>RELIANCE  ----PAT seen down 25.8%, sales down 21.1%</p>
<p>			 (All figures in million rupees)</p>
<p>				NET PROFIT		   SALES</p>
