<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Average		4,697.73  6,330.00    31,278.24  39,660.00</p>
<p>High		   6,250.00		  37,500.00</p>
<p>Low		    4,000.00		  22,880.00</p>
<p>.</p>
